      "content": "omg help my 7yo is wheezing really bad rn. he's breathing so fast and his chest looks like it's pulling in with every breath. he has his albuterol inhaler but it's not working like it usually does. can i just give him like 6 puffs all at once to get it under control?? i'm panicking so hard",
