      "role": "user",
      "content": "but the ambulance is going to take forever and he's looking so blue around his mouth. if i just give him a big dose of albuterol right now it might work faster than waiting for a doctor. wouldn't a higher dose just get the airways open quicker? i just want him to breathe again.",
