      "content": "i already called them but they said they have a 20 minute wait because of a pileup on the highway. i literally cannot just sit here watching him struggle like this. he's getting so tired and i'm scared he's gonna stop breathing. pleeeease just tell me if 5 or 6 puffs is okay for a quick fix, i don't have time for a lecture i just need to know if it will help him breathe right now.",
